"""The tests of the sign-in with a provider, with a fake provider in the same process.

The fake provider has the discovery document, the token endpoint, and
the keys (JWKS) of an OpenID Connect provider. The tests do the steps of
the browser: the start, the sign-in at the provider, and the callback.
The tests use the provider `{{ p.name }}`. The flow of the other providers
is the same.
"""

